Column name: location Type: STRING Description: Service request location latitude and longitude coordinates.
Column name: council_district_code Type: INT64 Description: Council district corresponding to Service request location. Locations outside of the City of Austin jurisdiction will not have a council district.
Column name: map_page Type: STRING Description: Service request location corresponding map page.
Column name: map_tile Type: STRING Description: Service request location corresponding map tile.
